From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kuraka <kuraka@localhost>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:02:10 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(sidebar): collapse the inbox sidebar to icons
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Kuraka-Severity: normal
Kuraka-Missing-En: Hiding the inbox sidebar removes it completely instead of leaving its icons.
Kuraka-Missing-Es: Al ocultar la barra lateral de la bandeja desaparece por completo en vez de quedar solo con iconos.
Kuraka-Adds-En: The inbox sidebar can shrink to its icons and open again.
Kuraka-Adds-Es: La barra lateral de la bandeja se puede achicar a solo íconos y volver a abrir.
